  "summary": "若子数组中满足 nums[i]%modulo==k 的元素个数模 modulo 等于 k，则该子数组有趣，统计数量。",
  "insight": "把每个元素转为零一指示值，前缀计数为 prefix。子数组条件是 (current-previous)%modulo==k，因此扫描当前前缀时查询余数为 current-k 的历史前缀频次。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "k 小于 modulo",
    "前缀零余数初始出现一次",
    "取模减法要加 modulo 防负",
    "答案使用 long"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "indicator-prefix-remainder-frequency",
      "title": "指示前缀余数频次",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "把计数同余条件转为两前缀余数之差。",
      "steps": [
        "frequency[0]=1",
        "prefix=0、answer=0",
        "遍历 value，满足 value%modulo==k 时 prefix++",
        "remainder=prefix%modulo",
        "needed=(remainder-k+modulo)%modulo",
        "answer+=frequency[needed]",
        "frequency[remainder]++",
        "返回 answer"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n)",
        "space": "O(modulo)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/indicator-prefix-remainder-frequency/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/indicator-prefix-remainder-frequency/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/indicator-prefix-remainder-frequency/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
